      "quote": [
        {
          "at": 5.5,
          "end": 7.88,
          "text": "Djokovic defends his title.\n德约科维奇成功卫冕。"
        },
        {
          "at": 8.08,
          "end": 12.8,
          "text": "It's a record fourth trophy in Beijing for Novak Djokovic.\n他在北京拿到创纪录的第四座奖杯。"
        },
        {
          "at": 13.02,
          "end": 15.8,
          "text": "He's still unbeaten at this tournament.\n他在这项赛事依然保持不败。"
        },
        {
          "at": 16.26,
          "end": 18.2,
          "text": "Nineteen successive victories.\n连续十九场获胜。"
        },
        {
          "at": 19.7,
          "end": 23.26,
          "text": "And it was a well-earned victory this afternoon against Rafael Nadal.\n今天他战胜纳达尔，赢得实至名归。"
        },
        {
          "at": 23.4,
          "end": 25.4,
          "text": "The Serbian was the better man.\n这位塞尔维亚人表现更胜一筹。"
        },
        {
          "at": 27.04,
          "end": 29.9,
          "text": "And now the celebrations can begin in earnest.\n现在可以尽情庆祝了。"
        },
        {
          "at": 30.18,
          "end": 32.28,
          "text": "Djokovic is the king in Beijing.\n德约科维奇是北京之王。"
        },
        {
          "at": 32.58,
          "end": 35.24,
          "text": "He wins 6-3, 6-4.\n他以六比三、六比四获胜。"
        }
      ],
      "cx": 0.5,
      "track": false,
