          "text": "Can you believe it?\n你能相信吗？"
        },
        {
          "at": 1.76,
          "end": 5.22,
          "text": "Just a flurry of errors from Medvedev.\n梅德韦杰夫突然连续失误。"
        },
        {
          "at": 8.82,
          "end": 11.4,
          "text": "That's a brilliant combination from Djokovic.\n德约这套组合打得太漂亮了。"
        },
